---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import heroPic from '@assets/images/Lakkien_jako_2016-100.jpg';

const description =
  "As a guild member, you get the right to participate in guild events and use the guild room, as well as access to the guild's \
e-mail lists. In addition, as a full member you get the right to vote at guild meetings.";

const lang = 'en';
const slug = '/en/guild/membership';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Membership"
  background={heroPic}
  heroHeight="tall"
  lead="As a guild member, you get the right to participate in guild events and use the guild room, as well as access to the guild's e-mail lists. In addition, as a full member you get the right to vote at guild meetings."
  description={description}
  lang={lang}
  slug={slug}
>
  <a
    class="center-block rounded-button vertically-aligned-button"
    target="_blank"
    href="https://id.as.fi"
    rel="noreferrer"
  >
    ASID
    <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="margin-left: 0.3em;">open_in_new</span>
  </a>

  <p>
    Membership of the guild can be applied for and membership fees are paid on ASID regardless of the membership type.
    On the same website guild members can view and update their own details saved in the guild's membership register.
    Signing in is possible with an email address. Applying for full membership requires a verified
    <code>@aalto.fi</code> email address in the account settings.
  </p>

  <h2>Full Membership</h2>
  <p>
    All persons who are AYY's members can be accepted as full members of the guild. As a member of the guild, you get
    the right to vote at guild meetings, the right to participate in guild events and use the guild room, and access to
    the guild's email lists. More information about guild membership can be found in chapter 2 of the <a
      href="/en/guild/docs/guild-rules">guild rules</a
    >.
  </p>

  <h2>Associate Membership</h2>
  <p>
    A person who is interested in the activities of the guild and cannot be accepted as an actual or old member can be
    accepted as an associate member of the guild. The membership fee is the same as that of a full membership.
  </p>

  <h2>Old Membership</h2>
  <p>
    A person who has been a full member of the guild, but is no longer a member of AYY, can apply to become an old
    member of the guild. An old member does not have to pay a membership fee.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .center-block {
    margin: 2rem auto;
  }
</style>
